    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n7 Grange Oaks Avenue is a fantastic 4 bedroom house in this superb development in Kilternan.\n\nGrange Oaks is a premium development by B&C Contractors located on the sought-after Enniskerry Road. Surrounded by the thriving communities of Stepaside and Kilternan, these stunning homes are designed to offer the best of both worlds—tranquil suburban living with easy access to Dublin city, vibrant coastal towns, and the breathtaking Dublin and Wicklow Mountains.\n\nGrange Oaks is ideally situated to provide easy access to a multitude of amenities:\n\n• Transport: The nearby LUAS Green Line and QBC bus corridor connect you to Dublin city in under 30 minutes, with the convenience of Carrickmines Park & Ride close by.\n\n• Leisure & Nature: Spend your weekends exploring the stunning Dublin coastline or hiking in the Wicklow Mountains, all just a short drive away.\n\n• Amenities: From supermarkets and pharmacies to schools and cafés, everything is nearby. Golf, tennis, equestrian centres and other leisure and sporting pursuits are also within walking distance.\n\nPlease note that photos are virtually staged."
      },
